---
// Footer.astro - El Placer de Compartir & The Corset Society
---

<footer class="bg-elplacer-midnight-plum border-t border-corset-gold/25 text-elplacer-ivory/70 text-xs py-16">
  <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-4 gap-12">
    <!-- Col 1: Brand & Philosophy -->
    <div class="space-y-4 md:col-span-1">
      <div class="flex items-center gap-3">
        <img src="/media/logo_elplacerdc_x.jpg" alt="Logo" class="w-8 h-8 rounded-full border border-corset-gold/40 object-cover" />
        <span class="font-serif text-base tracking-wider text-corset-gold uppercase font-semibold">El Placer de Compartir</span>
      </div>
      <p class="text-[13px] leading-relaxed text-elplacer-ivory/60">
        Comunidad pionera en Colombia de libertad, erotismo libre de presiones y consentimiento consciente. Bogotá & Medellín.
      </p>
      <div class="flex items-center gap-3 pt-2 text-corset-gold">
        <a href="https://x.com/ElPlacerDC" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" title="X @ElPlacerDC" class="hover:text-corset-champagne transition-colors">
          <svg class="w-4 h-4 fill-current" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M18.244 2.25h3.308l-7.227 8.26 8.502 11.24H16.17l-5.214-6.817L4.99 21.75H1.68l7.73-8.835L1.254 2.25H8.08l4.713 6.231zm-1.161 17.52h1.833L7.084 4.126H5.117z"/></svg>
        </a>
        <a href="https://x.com/corsetsociety" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" title="X @corsetsociety" class="hover:text-corset-champagne transition-colors">
          <span class="font-serif font-bold text-[10px] border border-corset-gold/40 px-1 rounded">CORSET</span>
        </a>
        <a href="https://x.com/SegiSw" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" title="Directora @SegiSw" class="hover:text-corset-champagne transition-colors">
          <img src="/media/avatar_segisw_x.jpg" alt="SegiSw" class="w-4 h-4 rounded-full border border-corset-gold/40 inline object-cover" />
        </a>
        <a href="https://www.tiktok.com/@elplacerdc" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" title="TikTok @elplacerdc" class="hover:text-corset-champagne transition-colors">
          <svg class="w-4 h-4 fill-current" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M19.59 6.69a4.83 4.83 0 0 1-3.77-4.25V2h-3.45v13.67a2.89 2.89 0 0 1-5.2 1.74 2.89 2.89 0 0 1 2.31-4.64c.298-.002.595.042.88.13V9.4a6.33 6.33 0 0 0-1-.08A6.34 6.34 0 0 0 3 15.66a6.34 6.34 0 0 0 10.82 4.49 6.27 6.27 0 0 0 1.86-4.49V8.58a8.28 8.28 0 0 0 5-1.78l-1.09-2.11z"/></svg>
        </a>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Col 2: Ecosistema -->
    <div class="space-y-3">
      <h4 class="font-serif uppercase tracking-widest text-corset-gold text-xs font-semibold">Ecosistema</h4>
      <ul class="space-y-2 text-elplacer-ivory/70">
        <li><a href="/" class="hover:text-corset-gold transition-colors">Comunidad Principal</a></li>
        <li><a href="/centro-cultural" class="hover:text-corset-gold transition-colors">Centro Cultural Bogotá</a></li>
        <li><a href="/the-corset-society" class="hover:text-corset-gold transition-colors">The Corset Society</a></li>
        <li><a href="/the-corset-society/luna-llena" class="hover:text-corset-gold transition-colors">Noche de Luna Llena</a></li>
      </ul>
    </div>

    <!-- Col 3: Ética y Consentimiento -->
    <div class="space-y-3">
      <h4 class="font-serif uppercase tracking-widest text-corset-gold text-xs font-semibold">Código Ético</h4>
      <ul class="space-y-2 text-elplacer-ivory/70">
        <li class="flex items-center gap-2"><span class="w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-[#2e7d32]"></span><span>Consentimiento Continuo y Lúcido</span></li>
        <li class="flex items-center gap-2"><span class="w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-[#e65100]"></span><span>Cero Personal Comercial Pago</span></li>
        <li class="flex items-center gap-2"><span class="w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-[#b71c1c]"></span><span>Límites Innegociables</span></li>
        <li class="flex items-center gap-2"><span class="w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-corset-gold"></span><span>Discreción y Reserva Estricta</span></li>
      </ul>
    </div>

    <!-- Col 4: Contacto Oficial & Reservas -->
    <div class="space-y-3">
      <h4 class="font-serif uppercase tracking-widest text-corset-gold text-xs font-semibold">Línea Oficial</h4>
      <p class="text-elplacer-ivory/60">Atención directa y reservas:</p>
      <a href="https://wa.me/573194194785" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="text-sm font-semibold text-[#4caf50] hover:text-[#81c784] transition-colors block">
        +57 319 419 4785
      </a>
      <p class="text-[11px] text-elplacer-ivory/50 pt-2">
        El acceso se concede, no se anuncia. Derecho de admisión reservado.
      </p>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 mt-12 pt-8 border-t border-corset-gold/10 flex flex-col sm:flex-row justify-between items-center gap-4 text-[11px] text-elplacer-ivory/40">
    <p>© {new Date().getFullYear()} El Placer de Compartir & The Corset Society. Todos los derechos reservados.</p>
    <div class="flex gap-4">
      <a href="/privacidad" class="hover:text-elplacer-ivory/70 transition-colors">Privacidad</a>
      <span>•</span>
      <a href="/terminos" class="hover:text-elplacer-ivory/70 transition-colors">Términos de Admisión</a>
    </div>
  </div>
</footer>
